  },
  {
   "id": "s05",
   "text": "Persiapan, 1 file brand voice. Isinya, niche, audiens, nada bicara, kata yang dihindari, dan 3 postingan terbaikmu.",
   "w0": 32,
   "w1": 48,
   "speech": [
